    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in Bladework Stance.</p><hr /><p>You hop on one copy of your Favored Blade. You gain a fly Speed equal to your land Speed. As long as you're surfing on your blade, it doesn't count as flying above you.</p><p>You can dismiss this effect as a single action with the concentrate trait, the blade flying back above you. If you dismiss this effect while in the air, you start falling normally.</p>"
